        <mxCell id="21" value="Health and rollback controls: staging and production invoke the rollback workflow on critical failure; dev fails loudly without rollback." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="560" width="1060" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="22" value="No PR deploy path exists. There is no what-if / plan stage and no single-run dev-to-staging-to-production promotion in cd.yml: each branch push deploys only its own mapped environment. Manual approval is an external GitHub Environment protection setting and is NOT proven by repository YAML (UNVERIFIED)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="625" width="1060" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
